┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── XRPL Camp ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Lesson 6: Your Certificate                                                                                                              │
│                                                                                                                                         │
│ It records what you did: the lessons you finished, what you                                                                             │
│ sent, your public address, and the words you wrote. No seed,                                                                            │
│ nothing private. Safe to share.                                                                                                         │
│                                                                                                                                         │
│ The proof pack adds a SHA-256 hash, so an edit shows up. But                                                                            │
│ the hash is not what makes it trustworthy — anyone can                                                                                  │
│ recompute one. What nobody can fake is the transaction: the                                                                             │
│ pack names a hash on a public ledger, and that either exists                                                                            │
│ or it doesn't.                                                                                                                          │
│                                                                                                                                         │
│ Testnet is reset from time to time and this copy goes with it.                                                                          │
│ The mechanism is real; this particular record is not forever.                                                                           │
